Z||000000||rogergarrison||08-09-2001||08:08 AM||||Just saw on Today show that Washington DC just started a new program. They have UNMARKED patrol cars with radar driving around town. They dont even bother to pull you over, they take your cars picture and the only way you know you been busted is when a flash goes off - until you get your ticket in the mail. What the government gonna do next, install GPS in everyones cars (like the unnamed rental company) and send you tickets everytime it says your speeding.<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=9116379&p=34556781"> ||||reg||1
