Z||000006||Tigger||08-09-2001||01:12 PM||||hehe, that's a good one...<P>What if someone stole your car went speeding down the highway?<P>A week later they find your car smashed in a ditch or stripped in an alley.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>A month later you get the bill for a speeding ticket in the mail.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>Oh yea, well that's just great.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">||||reg||1
