Z||000010||LZeitgeist||08-09-2001||02:43 PM||||The photo and the name attached to the license plate number are proof enough for the courts. <P>Just like if someone gets shot with a gun licensed to you - you have shown negligence in your ability to own a handgun. <P>By allowing your car to be used to break the law, you have shown negligence in your ownership of the vehicle, and you are liable for its use.<P>Good luck trying to get out of a photo-ticket... oh, and the 'take a picture of your money and mail it in' thing is an urban legend. So the story goes, upon receiving the photo of the guy's money, the police department sent the guy a photo of a pair of handcuffs. Yeah, sure. I imagine what *really* happened is his license got revoked for failure to appear in court, and the guy had to pay even higher fines after his 'joke'. Ha ha ha... joke's on HIM.<P>------------------<BR>Patrick W. Heinske  --  LZeitgeist@aol.com<BR>1988 Red Fiero Formula<BR>- 1st Place - Stock Coupe - FOCOSEVA 2000<BR>- 3rd Place - Stock Formula - FOCOA Nat'l 2001||||reg||1
Z||000011||Songman||08-09-2001||03:21 PM||||It is my car and I can loan it to whomever I please. I don't care if they have 100 pictures with time and speed, they're still going to get a lawsuit instead of a fine out of me...<P>Someone mentioned Big Brother earlier... it will keep getting worse and worse until more of us stand up for our rights instead of just saying "well, it's the law" and rolling over...<P>Someone mentioned guns.. thank goodness that California of all places had the intelligence to pass a law that says that victims and families of crimes involving guns can't sue the gun manufacturer! Nobody sues GM if they are in a car wreck. The manufacturer didn't cause it! The gov't opened this up by finding against tobacco companies and making them pay people who sued them... I can't say about everyone here but all of my life there has been a warning on cigarette packs that says they are hazardous to your health... so if someone smokes anyway, let them deal with the consequences...<P>Rambled a little off topic as usual, but it all part of the same deal to control us and get money from us...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
